---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Print a shell completion script: rustman completions zsh > _rustman

Usage: rustman completions [OPTIONS] <SHELL>

Arguments:
  <SHELL>
          The shell to complete for
          
          [possible values: bash, elvish, fish, powershell, zsh]

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
